{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52551","headline":"其二 · 陈元光","name":"其二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岭海物产知君臣，黑鲤朝北葵向曛。\n岭海物产知慈仁，寒獭祭鱼乌哺亲。\n吴起学曾斯学[荀]（笋），欺君害民丧不奔。\n禄养生成忘义恩，不如鷄犬司门晨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈元光","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52551.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52551","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}